    "claims": [
      "Connects one or more logistics service providers",
      "No external EDI converter or EDI provider needed",
      "Ready-made mappings with business settings separate from technical formats",
      "Transfers via Azure File Share, AS2 or REST services",
      "Supports EDIFACT, ANSI X12, XML, IDoc and text formats",
      "Handles SSCC, GTIN, GLN, DUNS and packing hierarchies",
      "Sends customer addresses (PARTIN) and item master data (PRICAT) to the 3PL",
      "Sends shipment (INSDES) and receipt (DESADV) notifications",
      "Processes shipment and receipt confirmations with packing hierarchy",
      "Processes inventory reports and special movements (INVRPT)",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
